{"docid": "30112002", "title": "Philippine one thousand-peso note", "uri": "Q7185363", "text": "The Philippine one thousand-peso note (Filipino: \"Sanlibong Piso\") (₱1000; PHP 1000) is a denomination of Philippine currency. It is the largest denomination in general circulation in the Philippines. José Abad Santos, Vicente Lim, and Josefa Llanes Escoda are currently featured on the front side of the notes, while the Tubbataha Reefs Natural Park and the South Sea pearl are featured on the back side of the note.", "entities": [{"uri": "Q33298", "boundaries": [39, 47], "surfaceform": "Filipino", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q918448", "boundaries": [90, 102], "surfaceform": "denomination", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q17193", "boundaries": [106, 125], "surfaceform": "Philippine currency", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q3270447", "boundaries": [201, 217], "surfaceform": "José Abad Santos", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q3551646", "boundaries": [219, 230], "surfaceform": "Vicente Lim", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q3184073", "boundaries": [236, 256], "surfaceform": "Josefa Llanes Escoda", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q927108", "boundaries": [322, 350], "surfaceform": "Tubbataha Reefs Natural Park", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q3658757", "boundaries": [359, 374], "surfaceform": "South Sea pearl", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q7185363", "boundaries": [4, 37], "surfaceform": "Philippine one thousand-peso note", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "1000-01-01T00:00:00Z^^http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime", "boundaries": [79, 83], "surfaceform": "1000", "annotator": "Date_Linker"}, {"uri": "+1000^^http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal", "boundaries": [69, 73], "surfaceform": "1000", "annotator": "Value_Linker"}], "triples": [{"subject": {"uri": "Q7185363", "boundaries": [4, 37], "surfaceform": "Philippine one thousand-peso note", "annotator": "Me"}, "predicate": {"uri": "P3934", "boundaries": null, "surfaceform": "face value", "annotator": "NoSubject-Triple-aligner"}, "objec