{"docid": "30112004", "title": "Havnar Róðrarfelag", "uri": "Q5684020", "text": "Havnar Róðrarfelag is a Faroese rowing club in Tórshavn. Havnar Róðrarfelag was founded on 25 June 1932. The club is the most winning Faroese rowing club since 1973, and has won 61 Faroese championships, Argja Róðrarfelag comes second with 22 championships. The boats participate in the rowing competitions which are held around the islands in June and July, starting with Norðoyastevna in Klaksvík and ending with the final boat race at Ólavsøka in Tórshavn.", "entities": [{"uri": "Q4628", "boundaries": [24, 31], "surfaceform": "Faroese", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q10704", "boundaries": [47, 55], "surfaceform": "Tórshavn", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "None", "boundaries": [204, 221], "surfaceform": "Argja Róðrarfelag", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "None", "boundaries": [373, 386], "surfaceform": "Norðoyastevna", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q189361", "boundaries": [390, 398], "surfaceform": "Klaksvík", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q293048", "boundaries": [438, 446], "surfaceform": "Ólavsøka", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q10704", "boundaries": [450, 458], "surfaceform": "Tórshavn", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q5684020", "boundaries": [0, 18], "surfaceform": "Havnar Róðrarfelag", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "Q5684020", "boundaries": [57, 75], "surfaceform": "Havnar Róðrarfelag", "annotator": "Me"}, {"uri": "1932-06-25T00:00:00Z^^http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime", "boundaries": [91, 103], "surfaceform": "25 June 1932", "annotator": "Date_Linker"}, {"uri": "1973-01-01T00:00:00Z^^http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime", "boundaries": [160, 164], "surfaceform": "1973", "annotator": "Date_Linker"}, {"uri": "+61^^http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal", "boundaries": [178, 180], "surfaceform": "61", "annotator": "Value_Linker"}, {"uri": "+22^^http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal", "boundaries": [240, 242], "surfaceform": "22", "annotator": "Value_Linker"}], "triples": [{"subj